{
  "name": "🚀 Social Media Content Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ BACA SEBELUM PAKAI\n\n### 1. Environment Variables\nSettings → Variables → tambahkan:\n```\nOPENAI_API_KEY    → openai.com\nFB_ACCESS_TOKEN   → Facebook Page Token\nFB_PAGE_ID        → ID Facebook Page\nIG_USER_ID        → Instagram Business ID\nLI_ACCESS_TOKEN   → LinkedIn Access Token\nLI_PERSON_ID      → urn:li:person:xxx\nAYRSHARE_API_KEY  → ayrshare.com (gratis)\n```\n\n### 2. Credentials (Settings → Credentials)\n- Gmail OAuth2 Account\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 Account\n\n### 3. Edit node **Set Variables**\nUbah: `approver_email`, `report_email`, `topic`\n\n### 4. Edit **Google Sheets: Log**\nGanti `GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID` dengan ID sheet kamu\n\n### 5. Cara test\nKlik **Test Workflow** → cek email masuk",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "61d9719b-897b-4dfa-981f-24242887bb03",
      "name": "📌 SETUP INSTRUCTIONS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 KONTEN GENERATION\n\n**IF: AI atau Manual**\n- `content_type = AI` → OpenAI generate otomatis\n- `content_type = manual` → edit node **Set: Manual Content**\n\n**Untuk ganti model AI:**\nEdit node `HTTP: OpenAI Generate`\nGanti `gpt-4o-mini` → `gpt-4o` (lebih bagus, lebih mahal)\n\n**Untuk pakai Claude:**\nGanti URL ke `https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages`\ndan sesuaikan format body",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "6e6906d2-c524-487c-8761-b9f7e8b0022d",
      "name": "🤖 KONTEN NOTE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✉️ APPROVAL SYSTEM\n\n**Cara kerja:**\n1. Email berisi preview konten dikirim ke approver\n2. Workflow **pause** (Wait node)\n3. Approver klik **SETUJU** → lanjut publish\n4. Approver klik **REVISI** → AI revise otomatis\n5. Email dikirim ulang untuk review ke-2\n6. Setelah 2x revisi, workflow berhenti\n\n**Edit email approver:**\nNode `Set Variables` → field `approver_email`\n\n**Timeout:**\nJika tidak diklik 3 hari → workflow timeout",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a7c3f245-c584-483e-8216-d04848325d0b",
      "name": "✉️ APPROVAL NOTE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📤 PUBLISHING\n\n**Platform & API:**\n- Instagram → Facebook Graph API v21.0 (2 step)\n- LinkedIn → ugcPosts API v2\n- Facebook → Graph API feed endpoint\n- Threads → Ayrshare API (daftar gratis)\n\n**Image URL:**\nEdit node `Code: Prepare Publish`\nGanti `imageUrl` dengan URL gambar asli\n\n**Error publish?**\nCek env variables sudah benar di Settings\nCek token belum expired (FB token: 60 hari)\n\n**Ayrshare:**\nayrshare.com → Free tier 3 platform",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0b06f53b-0bd0-4fc2-9fd4-d57bd7eac809",
      "name": "📤 PUBLISH NOTE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2320,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 REPORTING\n\n**Setelah publish:**\n1. Email report → tim@email.com\n2. Data di-log ke Google Sheets\n\n**Setup Sheets:**\n- Buat spreadsheet baru\n- Salin ID dari URL (bagian setelah /d/)\n- Paste di node `Google Sheets: Log`\n- Nama sheet: `Content Log`\n\n**Kolom yang di-log:**\nDate, Approval ID, Topic, Content Type,\nIG/LI/FB/Threads Post ID, Status,\nRevision Count, Publish Time, IG Preview",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "17f096bf-266a-4545-b1b2-45e251305bc0",
      "name": "📊 REPORTING NOTE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
